OL,3,GNEWSACake shed owner chased thief who
OL,4,Astole her bakes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It might just be cake, but it's the
OL,7,Fprinciple and standing up for
OL,8,Fourselves," said Walton. "It's not OK,
OL,9,Fno matter what they've stolen."
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it was reviewing
OL,11,Fand pursuing lines of inquiry,
OL,12,Fincluding the video footage, but no
OL,13,Farrests had yet been made.
